{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":31,"ref":"2-chronicles 29:31","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"su","chapter":29,"translation":"Jeung Yekhazqiyahu ngajawab sarta nyebut: Ayeuna anjeun geus ngeusian leungeun anjeun keur Yahwe, arapkeun, sarta sanggakeun korban jeung kurban sukur ka imah Yahwe. Jeung jamaah ngasupkeun korban jeung kurban sukur, jeung saha waé nu boga haté sukarela, korban bakar.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויען","gloss":"ngajawab"},{"surface":"יחזקיהו","gloss":"Yekhazqiyahu"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"sarta nyebut"},{"surface":"עתה","gloss":"ayeuna"},{"surface":"מלאתם","gloss":"anjeun geus ngeusian"},{"surface":"ידכם","gloss":"leungeun anjeun"},{"surface":"ליהוה","gloss":"keur Yahwe"},{"surface":"גשו","gloss":"arapkeun"},{"surface":"והביאו","gloss":"sarta sanggakeun"},{"surface":"זבחים","gloss":"korban"},{"surface":"ותודות","gloss":"jeung kurban sukur"},{"surface":"לבית","gloss":"ka imah"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahwe"},{"surface":"ויביאו","gloss":"ngasupkeun"},{"surface":"הקהל","gloss":"jamaah"},{"surface":"זבחים","gloss":"korban"},{"surface":"ותודות","gloss":"jeung kurban sukur"},{"surface":"וכל","gloss":"jeung saha waé"},{"surface":"נדיב","gloss":"sukarela"},{"surface":"לב","gloss":"haté"},{"surface":"עלות","gloss":"kurban bakar"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-26T16:31:14.728517843Z","model":"glm-5.3"}